  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Buyer interest from $5,000,000.\r\n\r\nPALMA ON CECIL is an exclusive collection of just three standalone residences on their own freehold titles, architecturally designed by Shape Architects with a clear emphasis on space, quality and effortless modern living.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 230sqm to 265sqm of floor area, these substantial, beautifully proportioned residences offering four generous bedrooms, multiple living zones and superb indoor-outdoor spaces. \r\n\r\nEach home offers four bedrooms with two ensuites, including an impressive oversized master suite, complemented by beautifully designed wardrobes and exceptionally well-appointed bathrooms. Double showers, double vanities, feature baths and skylights reinforce the level of thought and specification throughout.\r\n\r\nThe kitchens are equally impressive. Extensive stone surfaces, full sculleries, Gaggenau ovens and integrated Fisher & Paykel appliances combine to create sophisticated spaces that are as practical as they are beautiful. Indoor natural gas fireplaces bring warmth and atmosphere to the living areas, while wet bars, considered lighting and high-quality detailing further separate these homes from the typical new build.\r\n\r\nResidences One and Three feature their own internal elevators, providing effortless access between levels and future-proofing the homes for years to come. Both also feature private swimming pools, creating resort-style outdoor environments that are increasingly difficult to find in a low-maintenance home.\r\n\r\nResidence Two has been provisioned for an elevator, allowing one to be installed should the new owner require it. Three standalone homes. Three freehold titles. Substantial floorplans, exceptional specification and a position only metres from the beach and Milford Village.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN'T REACH ANDREW DORREEN, PLEASE CONTACT HIS SALES ASSOCIATE ANNA JONES ON 021 489 171",
